  startingNode:
    dialogueText: 'Excuse you, sir: you''re in MY bedroom right now.

      You must
      have gotten the wrong room number. Please, leave.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962647
    - rid: 3046478613006778441
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 54, y: 170}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1205371044
      Part2: 1334103531
      Part3: 122334377
      Part4: 200998729
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: 'Excuse you, sir: you''re in MY bedroom right now.

      You must
      have gotten the wrong room number. Please, leave.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962647
    - rid: 3046478613006778441
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 54, y: 170}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1205371044
      Part2: 1334103531
      Part3: 122334377
      Part4: 200998729
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Is that so? Well, I don''t suppose your presence will be causing
      me any problems... otherwise you probably wouldn''t have been able to get this
      close to me...

      Tell me then, why were you so interested in finding me?'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778442
    - rid: 3046478613006778443
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 999, y: 43}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3420732108
      Part2: 1074501888
      Part3: 1118841494
      Part4: 3893310346
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "You don't say. As if being \"famous\" was the worst part of it.
      \nPeople like you wondering about my personal life, with nothing but questions
      in mind and cameras in hand, are just an unavoidable trait of my job.\nIt's
      the people who believe to already know enough about me who make things difficult,
      since they are the ones that always feel the need to... \"do something\" about
      me."
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778444
    - rid: 3046478613006778462
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2501, y: -133.355}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3751126033
      Part2: 1310427781
      Part3: 14493372
      Part4: 3819777033
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Why do you think I chose a place in the middle of nowhere such
      as this?

      Trust me, I know how to deal with these things... some day,
      someone will get me, but today is not that day, I know it...

      Then again,
      I''m not entirely sure why someone like you is so interested on my safety...
      unless...'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778450
    - rid: 3046478613006778451
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4025.8733, y: -382.50006}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 474974818
      Part2: 1123759463
      Part3: 482866062
      Part4: 531188890
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Not a great trait to have, I would say.

      I appreciate the
      interest, but please understand if I choose to end this conversation right
      here.'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778458
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5262.0347, y: -545.9999}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1438057026
      Part2: 1333072439
      Part3: 3932481693
      Part4: 3283696436
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...yeah, sure. And I suppose you''re now expecting me to "be cooperative"
      so that you may "protect me" from a "menace".

      Pro tip, kid: if you''re
      going to try and spy a major figure, make sure not to use the oldest trick
      from the book first.

      Do yourself a favour and get out of my sight.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778463
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5240.035, y: -263.9999}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1483341751
      Part2: 1304408155
      Part3: 2813616060
      Part4: 1763568454
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Lucky for her, she seems to be a bit vain to care about politics
      and my role in them.

      Admittedly, that could make her even more suspicious...
      but her focus seems to be placed on Mr. Artist instead.

      He''s truly
      useless, but hey, at least his weirdness makes him the perfect distraction...
      heh...'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778459
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4044, y: -53.99995}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3749489747
      Part2: 1155917834
      Part3: 3452398228
      Part4: 3866004631
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Let me guess, was it the man who always seems to look confused?
      Yeah, that''s... Ilya, I think his name was.

      I had to be driven here
      by him after his incompetence caused my car to stop working in the middle of
      the road.

      I would advise not spending much time with him, unless you
      want him to ruin your stuff out of pure idiocy.'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778466
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2501, y: 156.50002}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4061733524
      Part2: 1237221908
      Part3: 4047279270
      Part4: 4184659917
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "You were lied to, then. \nIt's already bad enough that I had to
      lose my suite to some... filthy artist; I'm not going to negotiate with a mere
      commoner like you.\nYou better find another room... or sleep downstairs, for
      all I care."
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413001
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1021.02264, y: 318}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2754526002
      Part2: 1138548354
      Part3: 498545549
      Part4: 1940995327
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'It''s what I get for trusting in the integrity of such a miserable
      establishment.

      You''d think that they would understand the idea of "reservation",
      regardless of how late one may arrive...

      But I guess that was too much
      to ask from a host who seemingly doesn''t even know numbers...'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413003
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2254, y: 395}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4043970722
      Part2: 1242736572
      Part3: 4036692107
      Part4: 387059162
    tag: 
